, 70.72, 70.94], ["covered", 70.94, 71.22], ["by", 71.22, 71.48], ["our", 71.48, 71.6], ["90", 71.6, 71.9], ["-day", 71.9, 72.12], ["money", 72.12, 72.34], ["-back", 72.34, 72.56], ["guarantee.", 72.56, 73.06], ["If", 73.58, 73.76], ["you're", 73.76, 73.88], ["still", 73.88, 74.1], ["seeing", 74.1, 74.32], ["the", 74.32, 74.5], ["link", 74.5, 74.66], ["below,", 74.66, 75.0], ["there's", 75.32, 75.52], ["still", 75.52, 75.66], ["stock.", 75.66, 76.02], ["Get", 76.6, 76.68], ["yours", 76.68, 76.9], ["before", 76.9, 77.2], ["it's", 77.2, 77.5], ["gone.", 77.5, 77.68]], "segments": [[0.0, 5.3, "I need to publicly apologize to everyone who bought capture cards last month because I lied."], [6.02, 11.32, "Yes, it's true. Capture cards pull dust mites up out of your mattress and pillow from deep in the"], [11.32, 17.0, "foam where the hot wash never reaches. Yes, customers tell us it's the first thing that touch"], [17.0, 22.06, "the itching that starts the minute they get into bed. After the creams, after the new detergent,"], [22.4, 26.76, "after fresh sheets every single night, none of that ever reached the mattress."], [27.44, 34.28, "Yes, it uses a plant-derived lure that draws mites from up to 50 centimeters away and an adhesive"], [34.28, 39.58, "layer that holds them so they can't get back into your bed. And yes, it takes 10 seconds."], [40.04, 44.26, "One card under the mattress, one near your pillow, and it works for three whole months."], [44.76, 49.54, "No sprays, no fumes, nothing to plug in. But here's where I lied. I told you our"], [49.54, 54.36, "Halloween sale was the best price we'd ever run. That's not true. Because for Black Friday,"], [54.36, 62.68, "it's up to 79% off plus up to 12 free cards. Choose 20 cards and we send you 32 for $89.90."], [63.4, 69.0, "Over 30,000 homes use capture cards and we've sold out before. So if you've been thinking about it,"], [69.26, 73.06, "don't wait. Every order is covered by our 90-day money-back guarantee."], [73.58, 77.68, "If you're still seeing the link below, there's still stock. Get yours before it's gone."]]}